# Chapter IV ends: with the Baron dead the Masterthief turns on her own guild.
# Jarko tells of the massacre, she waits in the Ruins of Storm, and once she
# is dead the Kanzler's men send the player to the Kanzler in the theater.
# Position stands in for the walks, and damage for the sword fights; ref
# FormIDs carry Arktwend's slot 05.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --from fall_jarko
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

# Jarko survived the attack on the guild.
case fall_jarko
run
player->PositionCell -123 470 714 0 "Stormwend, Thieves Guild"
talk DIEBJarkoderGaukler
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde2 >= 14
expect Diebesgildevar == 20
end

# The Masterthief in the Ruins of Storm, and why she killed them.
case fall_masterthief
run
player->PositionCell -204 5000 -67 0 "The Ruins of Storm"
until 600 MenuMode == 1
wait 60
choose 2
choose 3
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_SchwarzeSteine == 6
console 053D0C58.damageav health 10000
until 600 GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde2 == 81
end

# The Kanzler's men have seen it all, and send the player to him.
case fall_kanzler_men
run
player->PositionCell 1659 4980 -9 0 "The Ruins of Storm"
talk KanzlerMordWache19
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_IV_Diebesgilde2 == 86
end

# The Kanzler, at the theater, wants Calisto dead.
case fall_theater
run
player->PositionCell 555 1350 126 0 "Stormwend, Theater"
talk TheaterKanzlerBrutus01
ask still remember Calisto
choose 1
choose 3
bye
expect GetJournalIndex A_V_TheaterTreffen == 2
expect Stormwendvar == 20
end
